OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACriminals who skip sentencing will face
OL,4,Asolitary confinement or lose social
OL,5,Avisits
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe move is the latest bid to push
OL,8,Fkillers to attend court, with the
OL,9,FMinistry of Justice (MoJ) acknowledging
OL,10,Fthat longer jail time alone is unlikely
OL,11,Fto deter them if they are already
OL,12,Fbehind bars.
OL,14,F"Criminals should not be able to pick
OL,15,Fand choose when they face justice,"
OL,16,FPrisons Minister Catherine McKinnell
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
