OL,3,AMissiles hit Kyiv after Russia agrees
OL,4,Ato US call to resume Ukraine peace
OL,5,Atalks
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine's capital has come under a new
OL,8,Fmissile attack, hours after Russia said
OL,9,Fit was "ready in principle" to resume
OL,10,Fpeace talks and the US president said
OL,11,Fthe world was "the closest we've been"
OL,12,Fto ending the war.
OL,14,FSeveral houses were hit on Wednesday
OL,15,Fnight, injuring six people, Kyiv Mayor
OL,16,FVitaliy Klitschko said.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1792649885
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMissiles hit Kyiv after Russia agrees
OL,4,Ato US call to resume Ukraine peace
OL,5,Atalks
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe attack came amid a new diplomatic
OL,8,Fpush led by Donald Trump's envoys Steve
OL,9,FWitkoff and Jared Kushner. Witkoff met
OL,10,FRussia's President Vladimir Putin in
OL,11,Fthe city of St Petersburg on Wednesday
OL,12,F- a day after meeting Ukraine's leader.
OL,14,FThree-way talks were paused in
OL,15,FFebruary, after which Russia stepped up
OL,16,Fattacks as Ukraine ran out of
OL,17,FWestern-supplied interceptors to defend
OL,18,Fagainst missiles.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
